<title>USA: TSI Inc sees record FY97 sales, earnings.</title>
<headline>TSI Inc sees record FY97 sales, earnings.</headline>
<dateline>SHOREVIEW, Minn. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSI Inc said Monday it expected to report record sales and earnings for fiscal 1997 ending in March.</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $2.1 million and revenues of $20.2 million for the year ended March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;We anticipate posting strong records for both revenues and earnings in fiscal 1997,&quot; TSI chief executive officer Leroy Fingersons said in a news release.</p>
<p>Earlier Monday, TSI reported net income of $2.2 million, or $0.19 a share, in the third quarter, compared to $1.9 million, or $0.17 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>TSI shares fell 1/4 to 11-5/8 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
